Package: cosmic-utils-monorepo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ritesh Raj Sarraf <rrs@researchut.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rickysarraf/debian-cosmic
Recommends: cosmic-epoch-monorepo (= @VERSION@)
Built-Using: cosmic-epoch-monorepo (= @VERSION@)
Description: Unified COSMIC Community Utilities
 This package provides a curated collection of community-developed
 applets for the COSMIC Desktop Environment: a clipboard manager
 (clippy-land), a Dictionary lookup applet (cosmic-ext-applet-dict,
 backed by a localhost DICT server with an IPC toggle shortcut),
 a KDE Connect integration applet (cosmic-ext-connected), and a
 weather forecast applet (cosmic-ext-applet-tempest).
 .
 This package is strictly tied to the version of cosmic-epoch-monorepo 
 it was built against.
